WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 b4eb2e2746e8dbff369b3b0fac465f74

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:03.900
Karibu tena. Hadi sasa tumetumia kujumlisha, kutoa,

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:07.760
kuzidisha na kugawanya tunapofanya hesabu.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.400
Katika video hii, tutaanzisha moja zaidi:

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:16.940
operator ya mabaki (remainder kwa Kiingereza). Operator ya mabaki

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:21.060
inakupa mabaki, kwa maana hiyo, unapogawanya

00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:24.120
namba mbili, na tunaiandika kwa

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:27.980
alama ya asilimia. Kwa hiyo tukiandika 10

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.480
% 4, tunakuwa tunasema au tunauliza, "Nini

00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:34.340
kinachobaki tunapogawanya 10 kwa 4?"

00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:37.890
Na jibu ni mbili. Fikiria una

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:40.629
tuseme peremende au karanga 10, na

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:42.700
unataka kuzigawanya kwa usawa kati ya watu

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:46.390
wanne. Kila mtu anapata mbili, halafu

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:48.500
mwishoni kunabaki mbili. Na hicho

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:51.360
kinachobaki, ndicho mabaki. Hicho ndicho

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:54.750
alama hii ya asilimia inachokupa. Sasa, sababu moja

00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:56.840
tunayotumia hii mara kwa mara

00:00:56.860 --> 00:00:59.500
kwenye msimbo ni kwamba tunaweza kujua kama

00:00:59.560 --> 00:01:02.360
kitu kinagawanyika kwa usawa au la, na mtindo

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:04.490
wa kawaida zaidi utakaouona hapo ni kubaini

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:06.220
kama tuna namba shufwa au namba

00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:09.900
witiri. Namba shufwa, kama unavyojua, zote

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:13.620
zinagawanyika kwa usawa kwa mbili. Namba witiri,

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:15.580
unapogawanya kwa mbili, daima kunabaki moja.

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:19.500
Kwa hiyo ukichukua nne au sita au

00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:21.620
nane, ukizigawanya kwa mbili,

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:23.800
hakuna kinachobaki, ilhali tano

00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:26.140
na saba na tisa, ukizigawanya

00:01:26.180 --> 00:01:27.780
kwa mbili, kunabaki moja

00:01:27.820 --> 00:01:31.420
mwishoni. Kwa hiyo kwa kuandika if something %

00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:36.300
2 === 0, tunasema, "Je, kitu hiki

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:39.560
ni namba shufwa?" Na hilo linaweza kuwa na manufaa

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:43.100
kwa mambo mengi sana. Fikiria kuunda mistari

00:01:43.620 --> 00:01:46.180
ya rangi tofauti au kugawanya foleni

00:01:46.220 --> 00:01:49.260
katikati, ukimwelekeza kila mtu upande mmoja kati ya miwili

00:01:49.320 --> 00:01:52.240
anapokuelekea. Sasa, jambo moja

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:54.020
la kuzingatia: unaweza kuwasikia watu wakiita

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:58.480
keyword hii ya mabaki "modulo operator". Sasa,

00:01:58.520 --> 00:02:02.280
modulo na mabaki kimsingi ni kitu kimoja. Kuna

00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:04.440
tofauti ndogo ambazo labda

00:02:04.460 --> 00:02:07.900
hutahitaji kuzijali kamwe, kwa hiyo

00:02:07.940 --> 00:02:10.120
kwa sasa tutaichukulia kama operator ya mabaki,

00:02:10.240 --> 00:02:13.520
kwa sababu hiyo ni rahisi zaidi. Sawa, jambo la pili

00:02:13.560 --> 00:02:16.860
katika video hii. Hadi sasa, tunapolinganisha

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:20.020
vitu ili kuona kama vinafanana, tumekuwa tukitumia

00:02:20.060 --> 00:02:23.940
alama tatu za usawa. Lakini wakati mwingine, tunataka

00:02:23.980 --> 00:02:26.980
kuangalia kama vitu havifanani, na kwa

00:02:27.100 --> 00:02:30.020
hilo tunatumia alama ya mshangao ikifuatiwa na

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:33.400
alama mbili za usawa. Na kwa ujumla, katika kupanga programu,

00:02:33.480 --> 00:02:36.260
alama ya mshangao, au bang kama nadhani

00:02:36.320 --> 00:02:40.480
marafiki zetu wa Marekani wanavyoita, inamaanisha "si". Kwa hiyo fikiria

00:02:40.520 --> 00:02:42.480
unafanya kazi kwenye duka, na wasimamizi

00:02:42.540 --> 00:02:45.840
wameamua kwamba hakuna mavazi ya disco

00:02:45.880 --> 00:02:49.680
yanayoruhusiwa kuingia. Tunaweza kusema, "Kama vazi

00:02:49.760 --> 00:02:53.940
si la disco, fungua mlango." Kauli ya masharti

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:57.250
inafanya kazi vivyo hivyo. Tofauti ni kwamba

00:02:57.320 --> 00:03:00.420
sharti linarejesha kweli kama vitu

00:03:00.600 --> 00:03:03.880
vinatofautiana, na linarejesha sikweli kama

00:03:03.940 --> 00:03:06.820
vinafanana. Kwa hiyo tunaweza kuandika kitu kimoja

00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:09.260
kwa kusema, "Kama vazi ni la disco,

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:13.150
usifanye kitu. La sivyo, fungua mlango." Lakini kwa ujumla,

00:03:13.300 --> 00:03:16.160
ni rahisi na safi zaidi kutumia operator

00:03:16.280 --> 00:03:19.060
ya not ili kujua na kusema unachomaanisha

00:03:19.100 --> 00:03:22.540
kwa uwazi. Sawa, jambo moja zaidi, linalohusiana

00:03:22.549 --> 00:03:24.760
na tulichoangalia sasa hivi, lakini ni tofauti

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:29.049
kidogo. Wakati mwingine utakuwa na variable ambayo ni

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:31.620
kweli, na unataka kuipindua iwe

00:03:31.680 --> 00:03:34.480
sikweli, au utakuwa na kitu ambacho ni sikweli,

00:03:34.960 --> 00:03:36.220
na unataka kukipindua kiwe

00:03:36.260 --> 00:03:38.780
kweli, na tunaweza kutumia hili

00:03:38.880 --> 00:03:41.940
kufuatilia jambo fulani. Kwa hiyo fikiria tuna kitu

00:03:42.040 --> 00:03:44.120
kinachodunda kutoka kushoto kwenda kulia, na tuna

00:03:44.180 --> 00:03:48.079
variable inayoitwa movingRight, ambayo ni kweli

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:51.420
unapopaswa kusogea kulia. Lakini unapotaka

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:53.150
kuibadilisha (toggle kwa Kiingereza) iwe sikweli,

00:03:53.180 --> 00:03:57.040
unapofika kwenye ukingo wa kulia. Kwa hiyo tunaweza

00:03:57.100 --> 00:04:01.300
kufanya hivi kwa kusema, "Kama movingRight ni kweli,

00:04:01.900 --> 00:04:06.430
movingRight ni sikweli. La sivyo, movingRight ni kweli." Hiyo ni

00:04:06.440 --> 00:04:08.940
njia moja ya kuibadilisha variable. Kwa hiyo Jiki

00:04:08.980 --> 00:04:11.450
ataangalia movingRight kuona kama ni

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:14.220
kweli au sikweli, kisha atabaini

00:04:14.280 --> 00:04:16.480
kinyume chake na kuweka thamani hiyo tena

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:19.780
kwenye sanduku. Lakini kuna njia safi zaidi ya

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:22.100
kufanya hivi, na hiyo ni kutumia alama hiyo hiyo

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:24.960
ya mshangao, au bang, tuliyoiona awali.

00:04:26.020 --> 00:04:30.780
Tunaweza kusema movingRight = !movingRight, na

00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:34.640
hiyo inaipindua. !movingRight inamaanisha kinyume

00:04:34.680 --> 00:04:37.650
cha kile ilichokuwa. Kwa hiyo kama movingRight ilikuwa

00:04:37.700 --> 00:04:40.860
kweli, sasa ni sikweli. Kama ilikuwa sikweli,

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:44.220
sasa ni kweli. Jiki anapata kilichomo

00:04:44.240 --> 00:04:47.960
kwenye sanduku kwa sasa, na hiyo bang inamwambia

00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:49.860
atafute kinyume. Kwa hiyo kinyume cha kweli

00:04:49.920 --> 00:04:51.840
ni sikweli. Kinyume cha sikweli ni kweli,

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:53.820
kisha anakiweka tena

00:04:53.860 --> 00:04:57.100
kwenye sanduku. Hii ni sawa kabisa na ile

00:04:57.220 --> 00:05:00.060
kauli ndefu ya masharti ya if/else, lakini

00:05:00.140 --> 00:05:03.650
ni safi na fupi zaidi kuandika. Sasa, katika

00:05:03.680 --> 00:05:06.260
mazoezi yanayofuata, utatumia

00:05:06.300 --> 00:05:08.420
mambo haya mapya, pamoja na yote mengine unayoyajua.

00:05:09.340 --> 00:05:10.680
Furahia kuyatumia, na tutaonana

00:05:10.720 --> 00:05:11.420
hapa tena hivi karibuni.
